#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:46
msgid ""
"This effect/filter normalizes RGB video (aka histogram stretching, contrast "
"stretching)."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter normalizuje RGB video (tiež nazývané roztiahnutie "
"histogramu, roztiahnutie kontrastu)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:50
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:57
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:58
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:60
msgid "Output darkest / brightest input color"
msgstr "Výstupná najtmavšia / najsvetlejšia vstupná farba"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:61
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:62
msgid ""
"Colors which define the output range. The minimum input value is mapped to "
"the *output darkest input color*. The maximum input value is mapped to the "
"*output brightest input color*. The defaults are black and white "
"respectively. Specifying white for *output darkest input color* and black "
"for *output brightest input color* will give color-inverted, normalized "
"video. Shades of grey can be used to reduce the dynamic range (contrast). "
"Specifying saturated colors here can create some interesting effects. Use "
"the |color-picker| color picker or the color button to select the color."
msgstr ""
"Farby, ktoré definujú výstupný rozsah. Minimálna vstupná hodnota sa mapuje "
"na *výstupnú najtmavšiu vstupnú farbu*. Maximálna vstupná hodnota sa mapuje "
"na *výstupnú najsvetlejšiu vstupnú farbu*. Predvolené hodnoty sú čierna a "
"biela. Zadaním bielej pre *výstupnú najtmavšiu vstupnú farbu* a čiernej pre "
"*výstupnú najsvetlejšiu vstupnú farbu* získate farebne invertované, "
"normalizované video. Odtiene šedej možno použiť na zníženie dynamického "
"rozsahu (kontrastu). Zadaním sýtych farieb tu možno vytvoriť zaujímavé "
"efekty. Použite výber farby |color-picker| alebo tlačidlo farby na výber "
"farby."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:63
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Plynulý"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:64
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:65
msgid ""
"The number of previous frames to use for temporal smoothing. The input range "
"of each channel is smoothed using a rolling average over the current frame "
"and the smoothing previous frames. The default is 0 (no temporal smoothing)"
msgstr ""
"Počet predchádzajúcich snímok, ktoré sa majú použiť na časové vyhladenie. "
"Vstupný rozsah každého kanála sa vyhladzuje pomocou kĺzavého priemeru cez "
"aktuálnu snímku a predchádzajúce snímky vyhladenia. Predvolená hodnota je 0 "
"(žiadne časové vyhladenie)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:66
msgid "Independence"
msgstr "Independence"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:67
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:70
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:68
msgid ""
"Controls the ratio of independent (color shifting) channel normalization to "
"linked (color preserving) normalization. 0.0 is fully linked, 1.0 is fully "
"independent. Defaults to 1.0 (fully independent)."
msgstr ""
"Riadi pomer nezávislej (farebného posunu) normalizácie kanála k prepojenej "
"(zachovanie farby) normalizácii. 0,0 je plne prepojená, 1,0 je plne "
"nezávislá. Predvolená hodnota je 1,0 (plne nezávislá)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:69
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Sila"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:71
msgid ""
"Overall strength of the filter. 1.0 is full strength. 0.0 is a rather "
"expensive no-op. Defaults to 1.0 (full strength)."
msgstr ""
"Celková sila filtra. 1,0 je plná sila. 0,0 je pomerne nákladná operácia bez "
"efektu. Predvolená hodnota je 1,0 (plná sila)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/normalize_rgb_video.rst:77
msgid ""
"The Normalize RGB Video and :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/normaliz0r` effects essentially do the same but "
"produce slightly different results."
msgstr ""
"Efekty Normalize RGB Video a :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/normaliz0r` v podstate robia to isté, ale produkujú "
"mierne odlišné výsledky."

